{%- comment -%}
  The two honest signals under the size row: how many are left, and when it
  ships.

  In: product (required)

  The shipping sentence is lifted from the product's own description, because
  the store's shipping policy says per-item times live there: "some items may
  have longer processing times which will be indicated in the item
  description". Products range from 2 to 15 business days, so one line on every
  product would be wrong.

  The same-day countdown is built but ships switched off. Nothing on the store
  promises same-day dispatch today, so turning it on is a business decision for
  the merchant, not a default.
{%- endcomment -%}

{%- assign v = product.selected_or_first_available_variant -%}

{%- comment -%}
  The dispatch line is a single configurable line for now.

  Lifting it per product from the description was tried and parked: the
  descriptions mix dispatch times with delivery times in the same prose, so the
  parser kept returning sentences like "Metro capitals typically land within a
  few business days", which is when it arrives, not when it ships. Getting that
  right needs the descriptions to distinguish the two, or a metafield.

  Until then one honest line from settings, which the merchant controls.
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- assign ship_line = settings.pdp_ship_fallback | default: 'Dispatched within 1-2 business days' -%}

<div class="pdp-v2__signals">
  {%- if v.inventory_management != blank and v.inventory_policy == 'deny' and v.inventory_quantity > 0 and v.inventory_quantity <= 5 -%}
    <p class="pdp-v2__signal pdp-v2__signal--stock">
      <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 2 2 7l10 5 10-5z"/><path d="M2 17l10 5 10-5M2 12l10 5 10-5"/></svg>
      <span>Only <b>{{ v.inventory_quantity }}</b> left</span>
    </p>
  {%- endif -%}

  <p class="pdp-v2__signal pdp-v2__signal--ship">
    <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 7v5l3 2"/></svg>
    <span data-pdp-ship-text>{{ ship_line | escape }}</span>
  </p>
</div>
